# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository and on checkout.
# Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites Go sources, the embedded web UI
# assets and the TOML samples to CRLF, and gofmt -l then names every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.torrent binary
*.db binary
